// update.rhai.tmpl — the upstream version sweep for anda/<pkg>/ (`anda update`
// runs it; the sweep runs in the builder container with GITHUB_TOKEN set).
//
// Globals (andax): gh(<owner>/<repo>) latest release tag, gh_tag() latest git
// tag, gh_commit() branch tip, gh_rawfile() a raw file, get/get_json any URL,
// find/sub regex helpers, date(), and the rpm object (rpm.version sets
// Version and resets Release; rpm.global rewrites a %global; rpm.source
// rewrites a SourceN line; rpm.get/rpm.set raw spec text).
//
// Most useful: latest GitHub release tag of <owner>/<repo>.
rpm.version(gh("<owner>/<repo>"));
